  "historyNote": "#6889, eff 11-21-98; ss by #7808, eff 12-25-02; ss by #9824, INTERIM, eff 11-24-10, EXPIRES: 5-23-11; amd by #9880-A, eff 3-1-11, (paras. (a)-(c) & (e)-(k)); amd by #9880-B, eff 3-1-11, (para. (d)); ss by #10868, INTERIM, eff 6-25-15, EXPIRED: 12-22-15 New. #11029, eff 1-26-16; ss by #14558, eff 4-21-26, EXPIRES: 4-21-36",
